🛒 Sales Analysis Dashboard – Project 1
📊 Overview
This project presents a comprehensive Sales Analysis Dashboard built using Power BI Desktop. The dataset spans multiple regions and product categories, offering insights into sales, profit, and performance metrics over time.

👤 Author
Mxolisi Mnisi


🧾 Report Summary
Timeframe Covered: 2012 to 2015

Total Sales: $62.3M

Total Profit: $1.51M

Overall Profit Ratio: 2.4%

🌍 Regions Analyzed
Africa

Asia Pacific

Europe

Latin America (LATAM)

United States & Canada (USCA)

📦 Product Categories
Furniture

Office Supplies

Technology

📈 Key Visualizations
Total Sales by Year and Category

Total Sales by Category

Region-wise Profit and Profit Ratio

Sub-category Level Performance (Sales, Profit, Profit Ratio)

Returned Orders by Market

Top Regional Managers by Sales

Q&A Enabled Analytics (e.g., top cities by sales, states by profit ratio)

📂 Files
Project 1 Sales Analysis by Mxolisi Mnisi.pdf – Exported Power BI Dashboard Summary

🚀 Features
Interactive filters by year, month, and region

Visual insights on underperforming regions and profitable sub-categories

Drill-down capabilities for strategic decision-making

🛠 Tools Used
Power BI Desktop

Excel (data source, not included in repo)

📌 Usage
This report is useful for:

Identifying trends and profitability across markets

Optimizing sales strategies by region and product type

Enhancing business intelligence reporting skills

